A:\>SORT /?
Sorts lines of text

SORT [/R] [/+n] [[drive:][path]file]
  /R   Reverses the order
  /+n  Compares the lines from their column n on
A:\>FIND /?
Finds lines that contain a text

FIND [/V] [/C] [/N] [/I] "text" [[drive:][path]file]
  /V  Shows the lines that do not contain the text
  /C  Shows only how many lines it found
  /N  Shows each line after its number
  /I  Ignores whether letters are capitals
